node_modules
# `dist` is committed rather than ignored. `crates/cli` embeds it with
# `rust_embed`, and `cargo install --git` — which is how this tool reaches a CI
# image — never runs pnpm, so a binary installed that way embedded an empty
# directory and `site` failed at runtime with "embedded web assets are missing".
# The interactive view existed and could not be shipped.
#
# A committed build can go stale, so `just web-current` holds it: rebuilding must
# be a no-op, the same ratchet as `docs-current` and `notices-current`.
dist-ssr
*.local

